[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12480.309, "timestamp": "03:28:00", "text": "你不能回印度。夏天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12482.07, "timestamp": "03:28:02", "text": "你当然可以回到过去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12483.91, "timestamp": "03:28:03", "text": "夏季学期。是的。是的。夏季学期。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12487.229, "timestamp": "03:28:07", "text": "是的。是的。我当时在想……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12489.63, "timestamp": "03:28:09", "text": "因为你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12493.51, "timestamp": "03:28:13", "text": "所以我想，嗯，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12496.389, "timestamp": "03:28:16", "text": "考试每年举行两次，分别在六月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12499.03, "timestamp": "03:28:19", "text": "12月的时候，我就想，如果有的话……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12501.91, "timestamp": "03:28:21", "text": "学校放暑假之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12505.03, "timestamp": "03:28:25", "text": "先到日本，然后我就可以回印度了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12507.51, "timestamp": "03:28:27", "text": "然后写完考试之类的东西，对吧，或者如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12510.15, "timestamp": "03:28:30", "text": "我确实注意到他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12513.83, "timestamp": "03:28:33", "text": "为IGNU做一个国际项目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12515.11, "timestamp": "03:28:35", "text": "我不知道他们有没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12517.269, "timestamp": "03:28:37", "text": "日本，但如果真有的话，那将有所帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12519.99, "timestamp": "03:28:39", "text": "很多。所以，我可以参加考试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12522.07, "timestamp": "03:28:42", "text": "在线完成这件事，这样我就可以尽快办完了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12524.229, "timestamp": "03:28:44", "text": "正确的？而不是因为来这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12526.469, "timestamp": "03:28:46", "text": "来回折腾什么的，会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12528.55, "timestamp": "03:28:48", "text": "肯定很贵，对吧？机票方面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12531.91, "timestamp": "03:28:51", "text": "以及所有的一切。所以，我不想那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12533.91, "timestamp": "03:28:53", "text": "是的。嗯，有道理。是的，你确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12536.07, "timestamp": "03:28:56", "text": "想每六个月回来一次，或者"}]